{
    "schemes": [
        "http"
    ],
    "swagger": "2.0",
    "info": {
        "description": "Menggabungkan inventaris aset, laporan lapangan, dan peta jaringan irigasi menjadi satu gambaran kondisi jaringan, untuk membantu menentukan prioritas pemeliharaan.\n\n## Cara memakai dokumentasi ini\n\n1. Buka `GET /api/health` lebih dulu. Selama jawabannya `{\"status\":\"memuat\"}`, alamat lain menjawab 503. Lanjutkan setelah `{\"status\":\"siap\"}`.\n2. Pilih alamat di menu kiri, lalu klik **Test Request**.\n3. Isi parameter yang bertanda **Required**, misalnya `kode_aset` dengan `KW-0001`. Daftar kode ada di `GET /api/aset`.\n4. Filter bersifat opsional. Hapus centang filter yang tidak dipakai. Filter yang dicentang digabung dengan \"dan\", jadi `jenis=bendung` bersama `kondisi=baik` bisa memberi daftar kosong.\n5. Klik **Send**. Jawaban asli muncul di panel kanan.\n\nKotak contoh di samping tiap alamat hanya menunjukkan bentuk jawaban. Nilainya contoh dari soal, bukan isi data.\n\n## Contoh permintaan\n\n| Tujuan | Permintaan |\n| --- | --- |\n| Status impor | `GET /api/health` |\n| Semua bangunan | `GET /api/aset` |\n| Bangunan rusak berat | `GET /api/aset?kondisi=rusak_berat` |\n| Satu bangunan dan riwayat laporannya | `GET /api/aset/KW-0001` |\n| Petak terdampak di hilir bangunan | `GET /api/aset/KW-0001/dampak` |\n| Sepuluh prioritas teratas | `GET /api/prioritas?limit=10` |\n| Panjang saluran per tingkat dan kondisi | `GET /api/rekap/saluran` |\n| Jumlah temuan per kategori | `GET /api/kualitas-data` |\n| Impor laporan susulan dari folder data | `POST /api/impor/susulan` tanpa isi |\n\nDari terminal: `curl http://localhost:8080/api/aset/KW-0001`\n\n## Bila terjadi galat\n\nSemua galat berbentuk `{\"error\": {\"code\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\", \"request_id\": \"...\"}}`. Status 400 berarti parameter salah, 404 data tidak ada, 503 impor belum selesai.",
        "title": "Irrigation Network Condition API",
        "contact": {},
        "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "basePath": "/",
    "paths": {
        "/api/aset": {
            "get": {
                "description": "Every structure with its latest condition. Filters accept the same spelling variants as the source files, so `RR` selects `rusak_ringan`. A structure without geometry has `lon` and `lat` set to null.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "assets"
                ],
                "summary": "List irrigation structures",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "enum": [
                            "bendung",
                            "bangunan_bagi",
                            "bangunan_sadap",
                            "bangunan_bagi_sadap",
                            "bangunan_pelengkap"
                        ],
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Structure type",
                        "name": "jenis",
                        "in": "query"
                    },
                    {
                        "enum": [
                            "baik",
                            "rusak_ringan",
                            "rusak_sedang",
                            "rusak_berat"
                        ],
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Latest condition",
                        "name": "kondisi",
                        "in": "query"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Canal name, case-insensitive",
                        "name": "saluran",
                        "in": "query"
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/asset.ListResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "Unknown jenis or kondisi",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/aset/{kode_aset}": {
            "get": {
                "description": "`riwayat` holds every report matched to the structure, newest first, cancelled ones included. Reports dropped as duplicates are left out.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "assets"
                ],
                "summary": "Get one structure with its report history",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "KW-0001",
                        "description": "Asset code, e.g. KW-0012",
                        "name": "kode_aset",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/asset.DetailResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "Not Found",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/aset/{kode_aset}/dampak": {
            "get": {
                "description": "The tertiary plots that lose water when the structure fails: every plot whose water path from the weir passes through it, including plots tapped at the structure itself. A structure without geometry or flagged `jauh_dari_saluran` has an impacted area of 0.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "assets"
                ],
                "summary": "Downstream impact of one structure",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "KW-0001",
                        "description": "Asset code, e.g. KW-0012",
                        "name": "kode_aset",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/asset.ImpactResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "Not Found",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/health": {
            "get": {
                "description": "`memuat` while the data folder is being imported, `siap` once it has finished. Always answers 200, because the checker polls it during the import. Every other endpoint answers 503 until the status is `siap`.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "health"
                ],
                "summary": "Import status",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/health.StatusResponse"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/impor/susulan": {
            "post": {
                "description": "Imports `laporan_susulan.xlsx` from the data folder: new reports are added, reports with a known `id_laporan` replace the stored one, and reports with status `batal` are cancelled. The latest condition and the priorities are recomputed. Safe to repeat: a second call reports every row as `tidak_berubah` and leaves the same state.\n\nOptional: send the request as `multipart/form-data` with an `.xlsx` in the field `berkas` to import that file instead. The same cleaning rules apply and the response has the same shape. A request without a body always reads the data folder.",
                "consumes": [
                    "multipart/form-data"
                ],
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "import"
                ],
                "summary": "Import the follow-up reports",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "type": "file",
                        "description": "Follow-up workbook (.xlsx, at most 10 MB). Leave out to read the data folder.",
                        "name": "berkas",
                        "in": "formData"
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/ingest.FollowUpResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "The upload has no file in `berkas`, or the file is larger than 10 MB",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "The follow-up file is not in the data folder",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "The file is not a readable workbook, or has no `id_laporan` column",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/kualitas-data": {
            "get": {
                "description": "Counted per source row or feature that was repaired, flagged or dropped, across every imported file. The eleven categories required by the assignment are always present, with 0 when nothing was found; extra categories follow.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "quality"
                ],
                "summary": "Number of data-quality findings per category",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/quality.SummaryResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/kualitas-data/temuan": {
            "get": {
                "description": "Not part of the assignment contract; added for the data-quality page. One row per cleaning action: source file, row reference, problem and the action taken.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "quality"
                ],
                "summary": "List data-quality findings",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Finding category, e.g. aset_ganda",
                        "name": "kategori",
                        "in": "query"
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/quality.FindingListResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/peta/petak": {
            "get": {
                "description": "Not part of the assignment contract; added for the map. Geometry is WGS84. Properties: `kode_petak`, `nama_petak`, `luas_ha`, `luas_baku_ha`, `luas_geometri_ha`, `nomenklatur_sadap`, `kode_aset_sadap`, `tanda`.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "map"
                ],
                "summary": "Tertiary plots as GeoJSON",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/geojson.FeatureCollection"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/peta/saluran": {
            "get": {
                "description": "Not part of the assignment contract; added for the map. Geometry is WGS84. Properties: `id_ruas`, `nama_saluran`, `tingkat`, `kondisi`, `panjang_m`.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "map"
                ],
                "summary": "Canal segments as GeoJSON",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/geojson.FeatureCollection"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/prioritas": {
            "get": {
                "description": "Score = condition weight (baik 0, rusak_ringan 1, rusak_sedang 2, rusak_berat 4) x impacted area. Only scores above 0 are listed, highest first; ties are ordered by `kode_aset`.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "assets"
                ],
                "summary": "Maintenance priority list",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "minimum": 1,
                        "type": "integer",
                        "default": 20,
                        "description": "Maximum number of rows",
                        "name": "limit",
                        "in": "query"
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/asset.PriorityListResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "limit is not a positive integer",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/rekap/saluran": {
            "get": {
                "description": "Segment lengths are measured on EPSG:32749 and summed after duplicate segments are removed, in kilometres with two decimals.",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "canals"
                ],
                "summary": "Canal length per level and condition",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OK",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/canal.RecapListResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "503": {
                        "description": "The initial import has not finished",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/response.ErrorEnvelope"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
